      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - It’s always so upsetting when an upstart apprentice goes and runs their mouth! That potion of extreme stamina restoration would have sold like poutine on a winter’s day. So what if overuse leads to heart failure?  That’s no reason to ban it!\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_00 "
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 4935.0,
          "y": 4665.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "38"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - I’m looking for work, is there anything I can do? ",
              "_meta": "Player_AskHelp_SO_Up_Ladder_01"
            },
            "condition": {
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "QuestEventRef": {
                    "m_eventUID": "jfbuiFJoQUmQvaGJgH4HEg"
                  },
                  "_invert": true,
                  "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Conditions.Condition_QuestEventOccured"
                },
                {
                  "QuestEventRef": {
                    "m_eventUID": "kzDJ9rhsc0-qEowAOr5S2g"
                  },
                  "_invert": true,
                  "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Conditions.Condition_QuestEventOccured"
                }
              ],
              "$type": "NodeCanvas.Framework.ConditionList"
            }
          },
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No loc - I’m leaving.",
              "_meta": "Merchant_Generic_Leave_01"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 4919.0,
          "y": 4770.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "40"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Ah, you’re one of our new apprentices.  Be a dear and give me a hand, will you?  <color=#00CCFF><b>Gather 2 Nightmare Mushrooms give them to my man at the low-class inn. His name’s Pete</b></color>.  I’ll pay you for your trouble.\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_01"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 4830.0,
          "y": 4931.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "52"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Oh, and by the way, make sure to let him know his “order of spices has arrived”.  Got it?  Because that’s what this is.  A spice delivery. Got that?\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_02"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 4830.0,
          "y": 5040.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "54"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - Aren’t these...Poisonous? ",
              "_meta": "Player_Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_02_a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 4905.0,
          "y": 5145.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "56"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - That’s what some of my alchemists say, but I also hear it’s a very widely used spice in meat stews, so who’s to say, eh?\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_03"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 4875.0,
          "y": 5295.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "60"
      },
      {
        "_action": {
          "QuestEventRef": {
            "m_eventUID": "kzDJ9rhsc0-qEowAOr5S2g"
          },
          "$type": "NodeCanvas.Tasks.Actions.SendQuestEvent"
        },
        "_position": {
          "x": 4890.0,
          "y": 5415.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
        "$id": "62"
      },
      {
        "_position": {
          "x": 5310.0,
          "y": 4980.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.FinishNode",
        "$id": "65"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - It’s always so upsetting when an upstart apprentice goes and runs their mouth! That potion of extreme stamina restoration would have sold like poutine on a winter’s day. So what if overuse leads to heart failure?  That’s no reason to ban it!\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_00 "
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5415.0,
          "y": 4680.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "66"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - I’ve done what you asked! ",
              "_meta": "TimeSink_SO_Up_Ladder_player_b"
            }
          },
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "NoLoc - Farewell.",
              "_meta": "Merchant_Generic_Farewell_01 "
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 5640.0,
          "y": 4815.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "68"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Thank you for handling that delivery!  Here, your cut.\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_04"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5490.0,
          "y": 4980.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "74"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - I get the feeling that you just had me deliver weaponizable poison to a bandit... ",
              "_meta": "Player_Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_04_a"
            }
          },
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - I didn’t just participate in some kind of drug deal, did I? ",
              "_meta": "Player_Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_04_b"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 5490.0,
          "y": 5145.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "76"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - How RUDE of you!  This is a perfectly legitimate spice trade!  It’s completely ethical and above board!\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_05"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5535.0,
          "y": 5340.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "82"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Anyway, keep it up, Apprentice! With an attitude like that, you’ll make Initiate by the end of the year!\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_06"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5550.0,
          "y": 5460.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "84"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "No Loc - End of the year?! There’s no quicker way? ",
              "_meta": "Player_Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_06_a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 5565.0,
          "y": 5565.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "86"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Well, Victor Berthelot sometimes takes on Initiates pretty quickly.  Don’t believe any of the rumors about him, mind you.  The other Deans just want to poach his Initiates once he whips 'em into shape.\r\n",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_07"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
