      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - Well, Victor Berthelot sometimes takes on Initiates pretty quickly.  Don’t believe any of the rumors about him, mind you.  The other Deans just want to poach his Initiates once he whips 'em into shape.\r\n",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_07"
