        "$id": "114"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "No Loc - It’s always so upsetting when an upstart apprentice goes and runs their mouth! That potion of extreme stamina restoration would have sold like poutine on a winter’s day. So what if overuse leads to heart failure?  That’s no reason to ban it!\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Up_Ladder_00 "
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5761.0,
          "y": 4230.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "115"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "NoLoc - Would you believe one of my apprentices thinks I know nothing of Alchemy? I know how to make money off of it, isn’t that the same thing?\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Knife_01"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_ericakasper_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 5580.0,
          "y": 3660.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "117"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "NoLoc - My Master of Potioncraft is demanding a raise. I hate cutting down our profits, but he IS my greatest source of them...Bah, I guess I have no choice...\r",
          "_meta": "Naturalist_SO_Sabotage_01"
        },
